      "text": "Every artboard is clickable (Play).\n\nTry in Main:\n1. Switch EN | UA (login card or header)\n2. Sign in with Google (the only way in; notes sync across devices)\n3. Add a folder and a few notes, tick one off, search\n4. Delete a folder (dialog)\n5. Sign out\n\nOffline before the first sign-in: the login shows a note and the button is disabled (Start state: offline).\n\nThe Default folder is shown as General / Загальне (follows the language toggle) and has a lock: it can't be renamed or deleted, and both names are reserved.\n\nThe other artboards are the same prototype, opened at a specific state and language.",
